ion': ['The smaller BERT model that learns from the Teacher BERT through distillation.'], 'source_chunk_index': [16]}, 'Transformer distillation': {'description': ['A novel method designed for knowledge distillation of Transformer-based models, used to transfer knowledge from a large teacher model to a smaller student model.', 'A specific distillation method proposed for Transformer-based models.', 'A method used to transfer knowledge from a larger teacher model (BERT) to a smaller student model (TinyBERT).', 'A specially designed Knowledge Distillation method for Transformer-based models.', 'A novel knowledge distillation (KD) method specifically designed for Transformer networks.', 'A distillation technique used to transfer knowledge from a teacher model to a student model, specifically applied to Transformer models.', 'A new knowledge distillation method introduced in the paper.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 12]}, 'Knowledge distillation (KD)': {'description': ['A technique used to transfer knowledge from a larger, more complex model (teacher) to a smaller, more efficient model (student).', 'A technique where a smaller "student" model learns from a larger "teacher" model to improve performance and reduce model size.', 'A technique used in TinyBERT to transfer knowledge from a larger model to a smaller one.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 2, 12]}, 'Pre-training language models': {'description': ['The process of training language models on a large corpus of text data before fine-tuning them on specific downstream tasks.', 'Language models that have been trained on a large corpus of text data.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 13]}, 'GLUE benchmark': {'description': ['A benchmark used to evaluate the performance of NLP models on a variety of tasks.', 'A benchmark dataset used to evaluate the performance of natural language processing models on various tasks.', "The specific tasks within the GLUE bench