_chunk_index': [9, 10, 5, 15]}, 'Multi-head attention (MHA)': {'description': ['A sub-layer within the Transformer architecture that allows the model to attend to different parts of the input sequence.', 'The sub-layer within a Transformer layer that computes a weighted sum of values (V), where the weights are determined by applying a softmax function to the attention matrices (A).'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [5]}, 'Attention matrices (A)': {'description': ['Matrices used in Multi-Head Attention (MHA) to compute the weights.', 'A representation of the attention weights in a Transformer model, used in attention-based distillation.'], 'type': ['generic'], 'source_chunk_index': [5, 6]}, 'Embedding-layer distillation': {'description': ['A distillation technique applied to the embedding layer of the Transformer models.', 'A baseline for TinyBERT learning.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [11, 6]}, 'Prediction-layer distillation': {'description': ['A distillation technique applied to the prediction layer of the Transformer models.', 'A distillation process applied to the prediction layer of the model.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [14, 6, 7]}, 'Transformer layers': {'description': ['Layers within the Transformer architecture.', 'A component of the model architecture.'], 'type': ['generic'], 'source_chunk_index': [10, 6]}, 'KNOWLEDGE TRANSFER': {'description': ['The process of transferring knowledge from a teacher model to a student model, which is the core concept of knowledge distillation.', 'The process of transferring knowledge from larger models (teachers) to smaller models (students) like TinyBERT.', 'The process of transferring knowledge from a teacher model to a student model.'], 'type': ['task', 'generic'], 'source_chunk_index': [16, 13, 6]}, 'Task-specific distillation': {'description': ['A distillation approach where the Transformer distillation is performed on an augmented task-specific dataset to derive competitive f