cher BERT model.\n', 'Name:TWO-STAGE LEARNING FRAMEWORK\nDescription:A framework for TinyBERT that performs Transformer distillation at both the pretraining and task-specific learning stages. ; A framework that involves both pre-training and fine-tuning stages to capture general and task-specific knowledge. ; A learning approach employed for TinyBERT, involving pre-training and distillation stages.\n', 'Name:NATURAL LANGUAGE PROCESSING (NLP)\nDescription:The field of computer science concerned with enabling computers to understand and process human language.\n', 'Name:XLNET\nDescription:A pre-trained language model that has achieved success in many NLP tasks. ; A pre-trained language model built with Transformer layers.\n']split_entities: text_tokens=4022, instructions_tokens=500, budget_for_entities=5478, number_of_entities=157, avg_entity_tokens=39, max_entities=140, num_groups=2, entities_per_group=[140, 17]
